{The score of this game is not available. It lasted 106 moves. The game given
in early editions of Big/Mega Database is NOT this Hastings game, but another
played between the same players at the "British Empire Club Tournament",
London, October 1927. (The error arose due to a mistake in BCM, April 1928,
p174, which was corrected in the next issue, p223) Thanks to Luc Winants for
alerting me to this. The latest edition of Mega/Big Database 2020 shows that
this error has subsequently been rectified. Also, note that the game was not
actually played on 29 December as Colle did not arrive in Hastings until 30
December, but some days later (probably 1 Jan 1928).}  0-1

